# What the editor writes while the example is open: its caches and layout.
/.pulsar/
# What the editor and `pulsar package` generate so the project can build as a
# game (regenerated every time, never authored): the manifest, its launcher
# sources and the build output.
/Cargo.toml
/Cargo.lock
/target/
/src/main.rs
/src/lib.rs
/src/plugins.rs
/src/engine_main.rs
/Pulsar/level.json
